# Copy to .env.local for local dev (never commit .env)
#
# Local (Vite):
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
#
# Vercel (required for production):
#   Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Add BOTH variables for Production, Preview, and Development.
#   Redeploy after saving (Deployments → ⋯ → Redeploy).
#
# Supabase (Auth → URL configuration):
#   Site URL = your Vercel URL (e.g. https://family-ledger.vercel.app)
#   Redirect URLs = same URL + http://localhost:5173 for local dev

